    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original3.5m-wide representative coastal wall with an eroded low broad entrance, real thick roof/side walls/floor and a short blind cavity with solid rear. Whole volume modeled as one continuous surface from exterior face into the recess, not an old arch sealed by a plug. NPS supports basic sea-cave context; blind layout, local proportions, fracture simplification and palette are art choices. No copied real coast, ancient locality, exact rock age, fluid simulation or included water.",
      "zh": "原创3.5米宽代表海岸岩壁，具低宽浪蚀入口、真实厚顶、侧壁、底面及短盲腔后壁。外岩面至洞腔为连续整体曲面，不是旧石拱加塞封堵。NPS支持基本海蚀洞背景；盲腔布局、局部比例、简化裂面及配色为美术设定。不复制具体海岸，不主张古地点、精确岩龄或流体模拟，不混入水体。"
    },
